          <Pad Id="LJTuhn0i3B4lKywwg9sh8e" Bounds="760,613,400,30" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt;- chapter 01's three nodes, unchanged - the numbers just mean somewhere now. Copy it: it still travels.">
